+      + `on a branch whose last path segment is exactly \`${name}\`, such as \`agent/${name}\`.`,
+    `Commit as ${value('DSH_SUPERAGENT_GITHUB_ACCOUNT')} <${value('DSH_SUPERAGENT_GITHUB_COMMIT_EMAIL')}>, push the branch, and open a pull `
+      + 'request from it with the GitHub CLI. That pull request is how this request is followed; name its URL in your reply.',
